WEBVTT

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
kanashige ni saku hana ni kimi no omokage wo mita

00:00.567 --> 00:09.424
I saw your image in the flower that is blossoming sorrowfully

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
daisuki na ame nanoni naze ka kyou wa tsumetakute

00:09.937 --> 00:18.509
I love rain, yet it felt frosty today

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
kisetsu wa meguri mori wa somerare kaze wa kanadete omoi afurete

00:18.651 --> 00:37.226
The season changed, the forest was colored, the wind played a tune, memories overflowed

00:37.600 --> 00:46.786
tsuki no kakera wo atsumete yume wo kazari nemuru

00:37.600 --> 00:46.787
Gather the pieces of the moon, decorate the dream and sleep

00:47.020 --> 00:56.153
toki no suna chiribametemo ano koro e kaeranai

00:47.020 --> 00:56.154
Even if I sprinkle the sand of time, I cannot return to the past

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
ikiru imi sageshiteiru dare mo mina tabibito

00:56.313 --> 01:05.420
Those searching for the meaning of life are all travellers

01:05.769 --> 01:14.817
haruka naru tabiji tadori boku wa ima arukidasu

01:05.776 --> 01:14.817
I set my course on this endless journey

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
ibara no michi no mukou e...

01:14.837 --> 01:22.812
for the place beyond the thorny path...

01:25.832 --> 01:30.752
The artist of life who produces miracles
with his godlike scalpel skills.

01:31.671 --> 01:34.006
The surgeon whom the era has yearned for.

01:34.882 --> 01:35.925
Black Jack.

01:50.945 --> 01:52.269
Wow!

01:52.658 --> 01:54.258
It's white all over!

02:02.458 --> 02:04.751
What a great view!

02:04.752 --> 02:06.878
The air is fresh too.

02:13.219 --> 02:14.636
Wow!

02:14.637 --> 02:17.343
Doc, look! Hey!

02:19.058 --> 02:19.724
Oh.

02:20.184 --> 02:25.890
You lack the romantic side needed
to enjoy such beautiful scenery.

02:26.941 --> 02:34.072
I can fully enjoy this beauty for another
two hours, when we arrive at the inn.

02:34.323 --> 02:36.574
Once we get there, we'll take a walk

02:37.034 --> 02:38.535
and then play ping-pong!

02:38.536 --> 02:40.537
Once we're done sweating,

02:40.913 --> 02:44.165
we'll eat a yummy parfait in the outdoor bath.

02:44.703 --> 02:47.580
Then we'll go do karaoke.

02:47.581 --> 02:48.920
After that...

02:50.835 --> 02:54.296
I know you're having fun, but aren't
you eating a bit too much?

02:55.339 --> 02:57.173
It's okay.

02:57.174 --> 03:00.691
I've never gotten full from eating snacks.

03:07.393 --> 03:10.395
I still have this much left in the bag!

03:11.769 --> 03:15.136
The most snowfall in Japan recorded on this spot

03:12.766 --> 03:16.978
We are arriving at the Yamaga Village.

03:17.987 --> 03:20.029
Tsuyuko, we're almost there.

03:21.282 --> 03:22.532
What's the matter, Miss?

03:22.533 --> 03:23.783
Please excuse her.

03:23.784 --> 03:26.202
She's not feeling well.

03:26.203 --> 03:28.121
She's sick?

03:28.414 --> 03:29.664
Yes.

03:29.665 --> 03:32.709
We are headed for the Kowa Clinic in the Yamaga Village.

03:32.710 --> 03:34.586
We've been going there for two months now.

03:34.670 --> 03:35.420
Dr. Kowa?

03:35.421 --> 03:38.798
Yeah, he's the only doctor around here.

03:38.799 --> 03:39.674
I know.

03:39.884 --> 03:43.970
Besides, he's an excellent doctor.

03:43.971 --> 03:46.222
That's right.

03:46.223 --> 03:49.183
There is no doctor better than him.

03:49.184 --> 03:53.354
My son and grandkids go to see him too.

03:55.674 --> 03:56.167
Oww...

03:56.294 --> 03:56.901
What's wrong?

03:57.818 --> 03:59.736
You ate too much junk food, didn't you?

03:59.737 --> 04:01.404
Did you bring a digestive?

04:03.119 --> 04:04.638
I forgot.

04:07.161 --> 04:08.578
It's the Yamaga Village.

04:08.996 --> 04:12.123
Hey, Pinoco, let's go get some medicine at the local clinic.

04:13.417 --> 04:15.335
Take care!

04:15.336 --> 04:17.545
Say hello to Dr. Kowa for us.

04:26.805 --> 04:28.306
Tsuyuko, are you okay?

04:28.307 --> 04:29.515
Hang on.

04:29.516 --> 04:31.059
We're almost there.

04:31.060 --> 04:31.934
Almost there.

04:33.698 --> 04:36.845
Originally by Tezuka Osamu "Kowa Clinic"

04:33.698 --> 04:36.845
Good Luck, Kowa Clinic

04:41.994 --> 04:44.007
Sign: Cross with caution

04:45.616 --> 04:46.991
It hurts.

04:46.992 --> 04:49.243
Are we there yet?

04:49.244 --> 04:50.411
I can see it over there.

04:52.256 --> 04:54.132
Excuse us.

04:54.967 --> 04:58.678
I don't like how it looks!

04:58.846 --> 05:00.930
It's not a whole lot different from our place.

05:00.931 --> 05:04.184
I want you to take a look at me!

05:12.693 --> 05:14.569
The next person, please.

05:14.695 --> 05:16.780
Oh, Mrs. Yamada.

05:17.031 --> 05:17.989
Hello.

05:18.032 --> 05:19.157
How is she?

05:19.158 --> 05:21.284
Is she getting better?

05:21.285 --> 05:24.204
Doctor, please take care of her.

05:24.205 --> 05:27.339
Then please wait here for a little while.

05:28.667 --> 05:31.294
Good, the medication worked.

05:31.295 --> 05:34.506
The hard spot in your throat is gone.

05:35.216 --> 05:38.251
Thank you, Doctor. Thank you.

05:38.552 --> 05:41.137
May I work around the farm again?

05:41.514 --> 05:44.024
No, rest for another week.

05:44.475 --> 05:46.851
And keep taking the medicine.

05:47.186 --> 05:50.313
Thank you very much, Doctor.

05:50.689 --> 05:53.234
Thank you.

05:51.766 --> 05:53.233
Take care.

05:53.234 --> 05:54.859
The next person, please...

06:09.208 --> 06:11.418
Hey, there's some stranger here.

06:11.419 --> 06:12.805
He looks rather scary.

06:13.045 --> 06:14.379
A cop, perhaps?

06:16.924 --> 06:21.761
Maybe he heard about you and
traveled a long way to see you.

06:23.139 --> 06:24.973
That would be okay...

06:26.475 --> 06:27.916
You've gotten better!

06:35.422 --> 06:37.569
Okay, it's your turn.

06:38.696 --> 06:39.930
It hurts...

06:40.197 --> 06:41.239
It's okay.

06:43.242 --> 06:44.962
What's the matter, Missy?

06:44.995 --> 06:47.579
Did you eat too many snacks?

06:58.090 --> 06:58.590
No!

06:58.591 --> 07:01.301
I don't want such a shor...

07:01.844 --> 07:03.344
H-how cocky!

07:03.345 --> 07:03.887
No!

07:03.888 --> 07:08.263
I don't want to be treated by a little
grump in a place like this!

07:08.384 --> 07:11.644
I want Doc to take a look at me!

07:11.896 --> 07:13.690
Don't be so selfish.

07:13.939 --> 07:15.773
This is my clinic.

07:16.025 --> 07:17.775
I will see you.

07:18.817 --> 07:19.530
No!

07:27.995 --> 07:29.329
I can't help it.

07:29.330 --> 07:32.707
I'll just get the digestive.

07:32.958 --> 07:33.875
Thank you.

07:36.962 --> 07:38.531
She's gotten so skinny,

07:38.714 --> 07:41.257
her arms won't stop shaking,

07:41.258 --> 07:43.343
and she can't sleep at night because of the sweating.

07:44.428 --> 07:46.429
Maybe she needs more medicine.

07:46.805 --> 07:50.350
But I'm worried about an overdose.

07:50.351 --> 07:52.936
There's nothing to worry about.

07:52.937 --> 07:55.605
My medicine is the best in the country.

07:59.008 --> 08:01.361
Actually, you'd better operate on her.

08:02.196 --> 08:04.529
You're not from around here.

08:04.740 --> 08:07.122
I've never seen you.

08:07.701 --> 08:09.249
She is in critical condition.

08:09.495 --> 08:11.412
You'd better operate on her.

08:13.040 --> 08:16.250
She must have Basedow's Syndrome.

08:13.040 --> 08:16.250
Note: Basedow's Syndrome is a type of hyperthyroidism

08:16.794 --> 08:19.352
Are you a doctor?

08:19.922 --> 08:23.758
She's sweating, she's shaking at the limbs, her eyes
are bulging, and she has a swollen throat.

08:24.259 --> 08:26.240
Are you using methylthiouracil?

08:26.428 --> 08:27.595
Or iodine?

08:28.806 --> 08:31.224
W-w-wait a minute!

08:31.225 --> 08:31.974
Wait a minute!

08:31.975 --> 08:34.018
Come over here!

08:35.979 --> 08:40.316
Don't mention the name of my medicine
in front of the patients!

08:40.317 --> 08:41.693
You are a client.

08:41.694 --> 08:42.912
I cure.

08:43.112 --> 08:45.196
That's how it works.

08:46.490 --> 08:49.033
But your treatment isn't working.

08:49.451 --> 08:52.120
I believe she needs to be operated on immediately.

08:52.121 --> 08:54.503
Shut up!

08:55.958 --> 09:00.378
Are you a real doctor?

09:04.425 --> 09:05.174
No.

09:05.884 --> 09:08.009
You're not a doctor?

09:09.805 --> 09:10.847
No.

09:10.848 --> 09:12.765
Then are you a medical student?

09:12.766 --> 09:15.309
You look too old to be one.

09:17.062 --> 09:21.149
As you guessed, I'm an unlicensed doctor.

09:24.778 --> 09:26.446
I have my practice,

09:27.072 --> 09:28.573
but it's underground.

09:31.160 --> 09:33.911
Doc, where are you?

09:33.912 --> 09:35.163
Get out!

09:37.499 --> 09:40.209
| don't have the time to be talking with you!

09:40.210 --> 09:42.837
I work so they are cured!

09:43.464 --> 09:47.091
But' I'm telling you that it won't work!

09:47.759 --> 09:50.887
She's in danger unless you operate on her thyroid gland.

09:51.805 --> 09:55.057
Th-thyroid gland...

10:18.790 --> 10:21.417
The thyroid gland is very difficult to work on.

10:23.587 --> 10:26.255
It's best if we can avoid it.

10:28.217 --> 10:30.384
Can you do it?

10:30.385 --> 10:31.052
Yes.

10:33.931 --> 10:37.975
I will assist you if you'd like, so why don't you do it?

10:37.976 --> 10:39.195
You will?

10:39.465 --> 10:40.811
Assist me?

10:42.397 --> 10:45.358
Suppose we go ahead with the operation.

10:45.651 --> 10:48.037
What if it fails?

10:48.528 --> 10:50.571
It'll be a big problem!

10:50.572 --> 10:53.074
Doc will be fine.

10:53.075 --> 10:58.120
sHe is highly skilled, unlike some little grump.

10:58.121 --> 11:00.289
He can cure any illness!

11:01.166 --> 11:04.669
I guess this little grump's not confident.

11:04.670 --> 11:08.381
Perhaps Doc and I should handle this.

11:08.738 --> 11:09.674
What?!

11:09.675 --> 11:11.717
How dare you, acting so cocky
even though you're just a kid!

11:11.718 --> 11:13.918
I'm not a kid!

11:14.005 --> 11:15.855
I'm eighteen.

11:16.198 --> 11:18.463
I'm sixty!

11:20.477 --> 11:21.894
Fine!

11:22.980 --> 11:25.398
I'll do it!

11:26.650 --> 11:30.695
I will take over for you if it starts to look bad.

11:31.655 --> 11:33.781
I'll support you too.

11:34.449 --> 11:36.575
As if a brat would know anything.

11:36.576 --> 11:39.277
As if an old scum would know anything.

11:51.383 --> 11:52.646
Me too.

12:00.142 --> 12:01.308
And then...

12:03.228 --> 12:04.061
How's that?

12:11.236 --> 12:12.153
Doctor?

12:12.612 --> 12:14.864
All right, let's begin!

12:14.865 --> 12:15.906
Watch quietly.

12:16.700 --> 12:18.909
There's nothing to worry about.

12:19.369 --> 12:20.578
Be confident.

12:27.669 --> 12:30.087
Excuse me, but do-you have any surgical experience?

12:31.715 --> 12:34.633
I-I-I performed an a-appendectomy just the other day.

12:38.263 --> 12:40.097
Right, you cut there.

12:41.141 --> 12:42.057
Clamps!

12:42.976 --> 12:44.059
Yes.

12:44.769 --> 12:46.145
Hurry up!

12:46.146 --> 12:47.146
I need them right now!

12:47.147 --> 12:48.772
I'm getting to it!

12:49.065 --> 12:51.689
Doctor, your hands are shaking.

12:52.360 --> 12:54.195
Of course.

12:54.196 --> 12:55.738
It's a major operation.

12:55.739 --> 12:57.406
Anyone would be nervous.

12:58.950 --> 13:01.327
Don't damage the laryngeal nerve.

13:05.540 --> 13:06.540
Clamps.

13:06.833 --> 13:08.667
Hurry, hurry! The clamps!

13:08.668 --> 13:09.585
Okay!

13:09.794 --> 13:12.379
Doctor, you're sweating a lot.

13:12.380 --> 13:13.422
Would you like me to wipe it?

13:13.423 --> 13:14.548
Leave me alone!

13:20.180 --> 13:21.222
Well done!

13:24.434 --> 13:25.309
Clamps!

13:37.447 --> 13:38.614
You've done it.

13:38.615 --> 13:39.490
Well done.

13:40.367 --> 13:41.428
I did it.

13:41.660 --> 13:44.690
It was the biggest operation of my life.

13:44.996 --> 13:48.415
The little grump is pretty good.

13:58.260 --> 14:00.970
Aren't there any other doctors around here besides you?

14:00.971 --> 14:04.390
No, just me.

14:04.391 --> 14:08.143
There were no doctors here before I came.

14:09.813 --> 14:16.652
Back then, the villagers rode the bus for
four hours to see the doctor in town.

14:17.237 --> 14:19.780
How long has it been since you came here?

14:20.490 --> 14:22.241
It's been...

14:23.827 --> 14:27.121
thirty-two or thirty-three years, maybe?

14:27.622 --> 14:31.625
I came here right after I finished my
internship at Yamato University.

14:33.753 --> 14:37.965
Back then, I was young just like you.

14:38.550 --> 14:42.860
But Doc is more handsome.

14:45.015 --> 14:49.309
Oh no, when I was young, I was too...

14:51.146 --> 14:52.312
Doctor!

14:52.313 --> 14:54.148
The patient is in pain!

14:54.149 --> 14:55.774
She's about to die!

15:05.034 --> 15:06.049
How high?

15:06.745 --> 15:08.912
It's up to 42 degrees.

15:09.330 --> 15:10.998
She's in shock.

15:10.999 --> 15:12.416
She's unconscious.

15:12.500 --> 15:14.251
Was the operation unsuccessful?

15:14.252 --> 15:16.003
Or did she get infected?

15:16.463 --> 15:19.295
I operated on her properly!

15:19.549 --> 15:22.301
Hey, you saw it.

15:22.594 --> 15:26.346
I extracted the majority of the thyroid
gland, leaving a chunk behind.

15:26.347 --> 15:28.015
I didn't miss anything!

15:28.641 --> 15:34.897
This is what happens when you don't give a patient
enough methylthiouracil and Lugol's iodine.

15:35.315 --> 15:38.233
Did you use the wrong medicine?

15:39.819 --> 15:42.196
W-What do I need to do?

15:42.530 --> 15:47.697
Tell me if you know! Please!

15:48.953 --> 15:50.953
You'll be fine.

15:51.623 --> 15:54.144
Your surgical skills were fine.

15:54.834 --> 15:56.490
Do the best you can.

15:57.795 --> 15:58.795
Fine!

15:59.672 --> 16:01.131
I'll do it.

16:01.174 --> 16:02.299
No matter what.

16:06.788 --> 16:07.788
Here?

16:07.995 --> 16:08.651
Good.

16:12.060 --> 16:13.101
Let's see...

16:13.645 --> 16:14.770
Let's see...

16:25.406 --> 16:27.032
Try a tranquilizer.

16:27.909 --> 16:29.326
And some steroids too.

16:33.748 --> 16:34.645
Do we have them?

16:35.291 --> 16:36.957
Yes, we do!

16:37.126 --> 16:38.081
Good!

16:42.674 --> 16:43.257
Iodine.

16:43.258 --> 16:45.092
Iodine! Iodine! Iodine!

16:45.093 --> 16:46.093
Iodine!

16:46.094 --> 16:47.552
Use a rectum injection.

16:49.264 --> 16:50.472
Oxygen mask.

16:52.350 --> 16:54.643
It will help if you put an ice bag on her chest.

16:56.187 --> 16:56.895
Yes!

16:57.230 --> 17:00.774
Also, watch out for tetany.

17:00.775 --> 17:02.859
Keep giving her iodine for a while.

17:05.154 --> 17:09.283
I've written the details beside the medical file.

17:09.951 --> 17:10.742
Bye.

17:16.082 --> 17:17.457
U-um...

17:17.709 --> 17:20.919
Hey, can we make it to the hot spring?

17:20.920 --> 17:21.920
We should be fine.

17:21.921 --> 17:23.380
Yay!

17:24.299 --> 17:25.757
Hey!

17:25.758 --> 17:27.384
Wait!

17:30.596 --> 17:32.472
Owwww!

17:33.307 --> 17:35.956
Little doctor, are you okay?

17:36.686 --> 17:40.063
You don't have to rush out so quickly.

17:40.940 --> 17:44.317
I'd love to hear your names.

17:46.279 --> 17:48.090
Let's forget about each other.

17:48.322 --> 17:51.531
But I can't.

17:51.784 --> 17:54.703
You can't be unlicensed.

17:55.329 --> 17:58.540
You must be a legitimate doctor.

17:59.876 --> 18:04.004
No, I'm unlicensed, like I said earlier.

18:04.630 --> 18:06.089
Just like you.

18:08.342 --> 18:09.927
Like me?

18:10.803 --> 18:13.764
I... have...

18:13.765 --> 18:16.144
No, you are unlicensed.

18:21.481 --> 18:22.314
But...

18:24.942 --> 18:28.069
Doctor, you're great.

18:30.364 --> 18:34.743
You've been practicing for over thirty
years in this remote place

18:35.411 --> 18:38.054
and are greatly admired by the villagers.

18:39.457 --> 18:42.959
I was very much impressed by you.

18:44.170 --> 18:45.860
That's why I helped you.

18:53.137 --> 18:57.557
How did you figure out that I don't have a license?

19:00.019 --> 19:06.233
Doctor, there was no department of
medicine at Yamato University back then.

19:06.859 --> 19:08.652
You couldn't have been an intern there.

19:09.278 --> 19:12.656
Doctor, be more careful from now on.

19:12.657 --> 19:13.573
Yup, yup.

19:14.200 --> 19:14.993
Bye.

19:15.243 --> 19:18.745
See you, little grumps! Bye bye!

19:44.855 --> 19:48.149
I'm really hungry!

19:51.070 --> 19:52.028
Again?

19:52.572 --> 19:54.788
I'll be fine!

19:57.910 --> 20:02.205
The little grump gave me some medicine.

20:03.457 --> 20:05.044
I'm ready!

20:21.600 --> 20:26.187
Mrs. Yamada, Tsuyuko-chan, let's take a break.

20:26.188 --> 20:27.647
Okay.

20:27.648 --> 20:30.358
I have your favorite, citrus tea.

20:48.753 --> 20:52.297
There's a sale on spring clothing.

20:52.298 --> 20:53.923
The shop doesn't stand out,

20:54.008 --> 20:59.888
but they always have cute stuff. I love it!

21:01.974 --> 21:02.982
Owww...

21:03.267 --> 21:06.269
Jeez, watch where you're going!

21:06.604 --> 21:09.230
I'm sorry about that...

21:11.233 --> 21:12.275
Doctor!

21:13.986 --> 21:15.734
Little Doc!

21:18.657 --> 21:19.702
Doctor!

21:19.702 --> 21:21.546
Dr. Kowa!

21:21.869 --> 21:24.162
What's with your outfit.

21:24.747 --> 21:27.540
Oh, how embarrassing.

21:27.541 --> 21:30.798
I wanted to get a proper education.

21:31.045 --> 21:34.214
So I entered Yamato University,

21:35.174 --> 21:38.176
at sixty.

21:39.345 --> 21:40.428
Great!

21:40.429 --> 21:43.306
Yay, Little Doctor!

21:44.188 --> 21:47.366
Oh my, it's time for my lecture.

21:47.645 --> 21:49.100
Well then, I'll be off.

21:51.524 --> 21:54.861
Good luck, Short Doctor!

21:55.861 --> 21:58.261
Pinoco, do you want some chocolate?

21:58.447 --> 22:00.031
Yay!

22:07.080 --> 22:19.035
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

22:07.080 --> 22:19.035
daisukuyo anata to hitotsu ni nareru no nara

22:19.153 --> 22:24.152
I couldn't be happier...

22:19.153 --> 22:24.152
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

22:25.721 --> 22:31.190
I wanted to see you forever

22:25.721 --> 22:31.190
zutto aitakute mattetano

22:31.734 --> 22:37.192
I'm laying on the grill,

22:31.734 --> 22:37.192
ami no ue ni yasashiku nekasete

22:37.796 --> 22:40.281
being heated up by you,

22:37.796 --> 22:40.281
anata ni hoterasarete

22:40.490 --> 22:48.267
so much that I change color

22:40.490 --> 22:48.267
atashi wa iro ga kawarukurai

22:48.352 --> 23:00.121
I dress up with sparkly grains of decorations

22:48.352 --> 23:00.121
kirakira hikaru tsubu no kazari de oshare

23:00.329 --> 23:12.060
I love you darling. Please love me more and more...

23:00.329 --> 23:12.060
daisukiyo motto motto atashi wo aishite

23:12.300 --> 23:23.651
I love you darling. If I can be united with you,

23:12.300 --> 23:23.651
daisukiyo anata to hitotsu no nareru no nara

23:23.837 --> 23:28.758
I couldn't be happier

23:23.837 --> 23:28.758
konna shiawase wa naiwa...

23:28.986 --> 23:33.920
How does it taste?

